          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Per-cell collision classification, for layers whose collision is authored per cell rather than per tile. On a bounded layer this makes the bridge cover the whole layer, including partitions that hold no tiles at all. Sampled while a partition is built and expected to answer identically for the lifetime of this bridge: changing what it returns does not invalidate colliders that already exist. Rebuild by recreating the bridge."
